# Our own telemetry collector (server/, wrangler/collect.jsonc). It goes in the repo and not in
# .env.local because Vite reads .env.local in every mode, `npm run dev` included -- one dev run would
# then pour made-up sessions into the live bucket, and this game is read twenty players at a time.
# .env.production is read by `vite build` only (a dev run sends nothing: src/collect.ts returns at its
# first line when this is unset).
#
# It is not a secret: it is compiled into the bundle, and any player can read it in the network panel.
VITE_TELEMETRY=https://dx.gamestao.com/c
